Code Description
================

Main script
-----------
code/spo2_osas_multimodal_classification.py

The script implements the numerical analysis pipeline used in the study.
It performs:

1. SpO₂ preprocessing and feature extraction.
2. Construction of A1–A11 feature configurations.
3. Stratified 5-fold subject-level cross-validation.
4. Evaluation of kNN, Random Forest, and Extra Trees classifiers.
5. Saving of fold-wise, class-wise, ROC, confusion-matrix, and OOF results.
6. Optional bootstrap and permutation analyses.
7. Extra Trees feature importance and SHAP-based interpretation.

